<br class="ltx_break">Edge-Cloud <span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">P</span>artitioned <span id="id5" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">I</span>nference for <span id="id6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">D</span>iverse VLA models
