<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE V: </span>Ablation Study of Dual-Threshold Partitioning on LIBERO Benchmark.</figcaption>
<div id="S6.T5.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:49.4pt;vertical-align:-22.7pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-42.3pt,6.1pt) scale(0.803066310531604,0.803066310531604) ;">
